{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212240","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1321224001:1":{"text":"アトカ画伯……","source_cn":"阿托卡大师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF55D04E58FEAA5F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321224002:1":{"text":"えっ！これをあなたが描いたのですか！？","source_cn":"呀！这是你画的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14B18C038EBE5B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321224003:1":{"text":"あっ、いや……こんな粗悪な絵を見たら、画伯の目を汚してしまうんじゃ……","source_cn":"啊，这种粗制滥造的东西，还是不要污染了您的眼睛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x983450D70A273A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321224004:1":{"text":"何言ってるんだ？あんたに見てもらおうと、彼は一カ月かけて描いたんだ！","source_cn":"就是他！他为了见您画了一个月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD244E5087245C445","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321224005:1":{"text":"ち、ちょっと……勝手に言わないでよ！","source_cn":"啊啊啊——不要说出来啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F8E9502BD5AADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321224006:1":{"text":"いや、モチーフと構図はなかなか良いですよ。","source_cn":"唔，构思和取景挺不错的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x374BAA79BAC0BFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321224007:1":{"text":"えっ……？ほ、本当ですか！？","source_cn":"啊……啊？真、真的吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E80E1B10F71DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321224008:1":{"text":"しかし……色彩の調整はもう少し必要かもしれません。","source_cn":"不过……色彩还可以再调整一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80F68BE8A9A7A5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321224009:1":{"text":"この部分なんですが実は……","source_cn":"这里我实在是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x535D5D054959BD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321224010:1":{"text":"適した色が見つからない？","source_cn":"觉得找不准颜色？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF55B0E3AC4B8DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321224011:1":{"text":"ど、どうして分かったんですか！？","source_cn":"您、您怎么知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x778B65D36E283036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321224012:1":{"text":"よくあることです。さぁ、この二色を混ぜてみてください。","source_cn":"正常！你看把这俩颜色混一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E6E188088DC9FD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321224013:1":{"text":"ここの背景はこんな感じに処理して……","source_cn":"这里的环境色这样处理……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA147B66AC1D20EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321224014:1":{"text":"なるほど……ずっと一人で悩んでたのがバカみたいだ！","source_cn":"原来如此……这个问题困扰我好久了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5D21442013A103E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321224015:1":{"text":"そうだろ！もう少し遅かったら、このアドバイスももらえなかったんだ！","source_cn":"嘿！幸好咱出现得及时，这要再晚点就真错过了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C180DB29A42D3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321224016:1":{"text":"本当に元気な雪だるまさんですね！この絵にぴったりだ！","source_cn":"这小雪人好精神！唔……把它画进去就不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF53FCB30056A2F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321224017:1":{"text":"ここに彼の明るさが加わったことで、本当にいい絵になったよ！","source_cn":"刚好，这里需要亮一点的颜色，它就很合适。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80A7E32E808E6B53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:画家派特":{"text":"画家のパルト","source":"画家派特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大师阿托卡":{"text":"画家のアトカ","source":"大师阿托卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪人":{"text":"雪だるま","source":"雪人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}